  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to update the HTML UI to enable the creation of Container resources that have an RDF body.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For example, this ticket is complete when a user of the HTML UI can paste the following text/turtle into a UI input field when creating a Container, and the created container will have the appropriate pcdm property.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "body.ttl----------\r",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "@prefix pcdm: <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://pcdm.org/models#"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://pcdm.org/models#",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ">",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<> a pcdm:Object .",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "----------\r",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
