  "description": "<p>This task is to update the HTML UI to enable the creation of Container resources that have an RDF body.</p>\n\n<p>For example, this ticket is complete when a user of the HTML UI can paste the following text/turtle into a UI input field when creating a Container, and the created container will have the appropriate pcdm property.<br/>\nbody.ttl----------<br/>\n@prefix pcdm: &lt;<a href=\"http://pcdm.org/models#\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://pcdm.org/models#</a>&gt;<br/>\n&lt;&gt; a pcdm:Object .<br/>\n----------</p>\n",
